、口紅を身に着けている。\n\n個性がちゃんと出ていれば、好きに描いてください。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sri0r8b", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nuko_009/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/868283c1/uploads/origins/c5dfff22-e2a4-4719-8dc3-e2d277e1235c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d484e3b16f076fc4c700c4754ac0b0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/868283c1/uploads/origins/c5dfff22-e2a4-4719-8dc3-e2d277e1235c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d484e3b16f076fc4c700c4754ac0b0, https://si.imgix.net/868283c1/uploads/origins/c5dfff22-e2a4-4719-8dc3-e2d277e1235c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9544217d3c25d8ea6686fba5f523a352 2x, https://si.imgix.net/868283c1/uploads/origins/c5dfff22-e2a4-4719-8dc3-e2d277e1235c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a6e269114134866c2dd0c2ff8338e99 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私のVtuberのキャラクターが水着を着てチョコバナナを食べているところを描いてくれませんか？\n\nキャラクター： https://imgur.com/a/BzOlNPY\nこんな髪型: https://imgur.com/a/iCp16wa\nこんな感じの水着: https://imgur.com/a/iHT4hlH\n顔の表情： https://imgur.com/a/bYuPemm", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nuko_009/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/77a869ac/uploads/origins/d12ae1b8-49d8-484c-b608-c0e4a4738e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7ebcbf85aa11c3ab6c5768110bbd3c7f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/77a869ac/uploads/origins/d12ae1b8-49d8-484c-b608-c0e4a4738e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7ebcbf85aa11c3ab6c5768110bbd3c7f, https://si.imgix.net/77a869ac/uploads/origins/d12ae1b8-49d8-484c-b608-c0e4a4738e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres